- control target: **{{ esp_target if esp_target not in invalid else 'n/a' }}**
- audio mode expected: **{{ not not_audio_mode }}**

### Context hint
- AppleTV/YouTube-like context detected: **{{ appletv_youtube_context }}**
- upstream app hint (packet/entity fallback): **{{ (upstream.app if upstream.app != '' else (packet_now_playing_app if packet_now_playing_app not in invalid else 'n/a')) }}{{ ' (' ~ upstream.app_id ~ ')' if upstream.app_id != '' else '' }}**
- passthrough source detected (optical/line-in/etc): **{{ passthrough_source_detected }}**
- packet now-playing entity source: **{{ packet_component_entity_source if packet_component_entity_source not in invalid else 'n/a' }}**
- passthrough stale-album suppression applied: **{{ packet_passthrough_album_suppressed if packet_passthrough_album_suppressed not in invalid else 'n/a' }}**
- passthrough metadata cache reused/age_s: **{{ packet_passthrough_cache_reused if packet_passthrough_cache_reused not in invalid else 'n/a' }} / {{ packet_passthrough_cache_age_s if packet_passthrough_cache_age_s not in invalid else 'n/a' }}**
- source attribution (source@target host:port): **{{ (effective_source if effective_source not in invalid else 'n/a') ~ ' @ ' ~ (effective_control_target if effective_control_target not in invalid else 'n/a') ~ ' ' ~ (effective_control_host if effective_control_host not in invalid else 'n/a') ~ ':' ~ (effective_control_port if effective_control_port not in invalid else 'n/a') }}**

### Deterministic next action
{% if cause == 'control_target_mismatch_esp_vs_effective_control_target' %}
- Control target is split between contract and ESP. Stabilize active target/host chain first (route/helper/ESP), then rerun this template before touching OLED formatting.
{% elif cause == 'control_target_mismatch_helper_vs_route_active_target' %}
- Helper target diverges from route-active target. Resolve target-selection alignment before evaluating now-playing render behavior.
{% elif cause == 'passthrough_split_brain_control_target_vs_now_playing_entity' %}
- Passthrough source is active, but control target and now-playing entity diverge. Force `spectra_ls.set_active_target` to `{{ effective_entity if effective_entity not in invalid else 'component_now_playing_entity' }}` and recheck host/target alignment after touching a pot.
{% elif cause == 'intentional_control_target_metadata_divergence_component_owner' %}
- Control target divergence is expected in this posture (transport control target + component-owned upstream metadata entity) and current packet is healthy. No target-alignment corrective action is required.
{% elif cause == 'control_target_vs_now_playing_entity_mismatch' %}
- Control target and now-playing entity diverge. Validate selection authority and active-target updates before investigating OLED formatting.
{% elif cause == 'meta_target_mismatch_component_owner_active_meta_vs_now_playing_entity' %}
- Component owns metadata, but active meta target diverges from now-playing entity. Fix metadata winner/selection alignment first; OLED symptom is downstream.
{% elif cause == 'title_missing_source_present_fallback_to_src' %}
- Title is missing while source exists, so OLED is falling back to `SRC`. Validate upstream media-title on `{{ effective_entity if effective_entity not in invalid else 'active entity' }}` and compare component vs runtime title fields in this packet.
{% elif cause == 'display_policy_suppressed_non_music_or_guarded' %}
- Display policy is suppressing now-playing output. Verify media-class/display-allowed contracts and policy guards before changing OLED rendering logic.
{% elif cause == 'esp_control_handoff_not_ready' %}
- ESP handoff path is not ready. Stabilize target/host handoff first, then rerun this template.
{% elif cause == 'metadata_freshness_stale' %}
- Metadata freshness is stale. Capture another run during active playback and check progress-clock update behavior.
{% elif cause == 'audio_payload_blank_expected_passthrough_no_track_metadata' %}
- Source is passthrough (`{{ effective_source if effective_source not in invalid else 'n/a' }}`) and no current track metadata is available. If this follows a brief metadata flash, inspect `packet now-playing entity source` and cache lines above to confirm selector/dropout behavior before changing OLED policy.
{% elif cause == 'audio_payload_blank_source_only_no_title' %}
- Source is present but no title metadata is available; OLED audio payload is blank (`-`) by contract in this posture. If this is an Optical/line-in source, this is expected behavior unless an upstream metadata provider is added.
{% elif cause == 'oled_not_in_audio_mode' %}
- OLED is not currently in audio mode, so now-playing assumptions do not apply to this frame.
{% elif cause == 'no_viable_now_playing_contract_fields' %}
- No viable title/source fields are available. Fix now-playing contract surfaces first (component primary, runtime fallback).
{% elif cause == 'src_fallback_unclassified_capture_more_context' %}
- `SRC` fallback is present but unclassified. Capture a second packet 10–20s later and diff control-target + meta-target + effective contract sections.
{% else %}
- No `SRC` fallback detected in this sample. If issue is intermittent, run this during the visible fault and compare packets.
{% endif %}
